<title>LEBANON: Chirac arrives in Lebanon.</title>
<headline>Chirac arrives in Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac arrived in Beirut on Thursday for talks with Lebanese leaders on the faltering Middle East peace process.</p>
<p>Chirac was on the fifth leg of a Middle East tour that will conclude with a visit to Egypt on Friday.  </p>
<p>The visit was his second to Lebanon this year and was intended to reaffirm French support for the country's sovereignty following his visit to Damascus last weekend.</p>
<p>Chirac will hold talks with President Elias Hrawi and Prime Minister Rafik al-Hariri.</p>
</text>
